==Description==
'''Vanguard''' is a [[Modifiers|modifier]] that only appears in the [[Vanguard (Challenge)|Vanguard]] challenge. It affects enemy stats, making them overall stronger. To compensate, starting cash is increased.

==Effects==
The main change in this challenge is all enemies are given the [[Nimble]] attribute.

==Update History==
*'''21 June 2024''' - [[v1.25.0]]
**'''Vanguard''' added.
*'''24 September 2025''' - [[v1.75.0]]
**'''Vanguard''' can now be exclusively activated in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode through [[Vanguard (Challenge)|Vanguard]] challenge.
***Replaced by [[Speedy Enemies]].



